  description: As the Iron Dragon Slayer, eating iron allows Gajeel to power up and
    even change his skin into scales of iron. He also goes by the alias "Black Steel."Formerly
    a wizard of the guild Phantom Lord, he was a member of the Element 4, who were
    equal to Fairy Tail's S-Class mages. After the war with Fairy Tail, Gajeel joins
    them.
